#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/xarray/accessor.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.xarray.accessor.GMTDataArrayAccessor:3
msgid ""
"The *gmt* accessor extends :class:`xarray.DataArray` to store GMT-specific "
"properties for grids and images, which are important for PyGMT to correctly "
"process and plot them. The *gmt* accessor contains the following properties:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/xarray/accessor.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.xarray.accessor.GMTDataArrayAccessor:7
msgid ""
"``registration``: Grid registration type :class:`pygmt.enums."
"GridRegistration`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/xarray/accessor.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.xarray.accessor.GMTDataArrayAccessor:8
msgid "``gtype``: Grid coordinate system type :class:`pygmt.enums.GridType`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/xarray/accessor.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.xarray.accessor.GMTDataArrayAccessor:10
msgid ""
"The *gmt* accessor also provides a set of grid-operation methods that "
"enables applying GMT's grid processing functionalities directly to the "
"current :class:`xarray.DataArray` object. See the summary table below for "
"the list of available methods."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/xarray/accessor.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.xarray.accessor.GMTDataArrayAccessor:16
msgid "Notes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/xarray/accessor.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.xarray.accessor.GMTDataArrayAccessor:17
msgid ""
"When accessed the first time, the *gmt* accessor will first be initialized "
"to the default values (``GridRegistration.GRIDLINE`` and ``GridType."
"CARTESIAN``, i.e., a gridline-registered, Cartesian grid), and then the "
"properties will be updated with the correct grid registration and type "
"determined from the source encoding (i.e., ``grid.encoding[\"source\"]``), "
"if it is available."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/xarray/accessor.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.xarray.accessor.GMTDataArrayAccessor:23
msgid ""
"Due to the limitations of xarray accessors, the *gmt* accessor is created "
"once per :class:`xarray.DataArray` instance. Thus, the *gmt* accessor will "
"be re-initialized in cases where the :class:`xarray.DataArray` is "
"manipulated (e.g., arithmetic and slice operations) or when accessing a :"
"class:`xarray.DataArray` from a :class:`xarray.Dataset`. In these cases, the "
"GMT-specific properties will result in incorrect values if the source "
"encoding is not defined or is dropped due to operations, and users need to "
"manually set these properties again."
msgstr ""

